Built with Android NDK 29.0.14206865, API 28, -O2, -DARG_MAX=131072,
-D_FILE_OFFSET_BITS=64, -D_GNU_SOURCE, external matched loader and
RUNPATH $ORIGIN. Baseline follows the installed binary's dependency policy
(libtalloc/libc; compiler may add libdl), not the contradictory older SHMEM
note. PROOT_WITH_LIBANDROID_SHMEM is not enabled for these pairs.
Both seccomp and process_vm build probes must pass.

Fastpath variant additionally applies fastpath.patch and preloads the accompanying
fastpath.c built for glibc AArch64 with Zig (-O2 -shared -fPIC).
SkyNetEmu's conservative read-only implementation is GPL-3.0-or-later.
The matched capability and instruction-address dispatch were inspired by
DroidDeck's patch 0014, but do not import its cwd synchronization, broad hooks,
metadata caches or global SVC rewriting. Symlinks and unsupported operations
retain normal PRoot translation. The corresponding source is included.
